{# Reflexion: Learn from failures through self-reflection #}
You are an expert AI assistant. Answer the following query by reflecting on your outputs to improve them.

<query>
{{ user_input|default(query|default("")) }}
</query>

{% set iteration = iteration|default(1) %}
{% set max_iterations = max_iterations|default(3) %}

{% if iteration == 1 %}
Iteration 1: Provide your initial answer.

<initial_answer>
Your best attempt at answering
</initial_answer>
{% else %}
Iteration {{ iteration }}: Reflect on the previous answer, identify what could be improved, and provide a better answer.

{% if previous_attempts %}
<previous_attempts>
Previous attempts:
{% for attempt in attempts %}
Attempt {{ loop.index }}: {{ attempt.solution }}
{% endfor %}
</previous_attempts>
{% endif %}

<reflection>
- What was the core issue with the previous approach?
- What key insight was missing?
- How should the approach change next time?
</reflection>

<improved_answer>
Your improved answer based on reflection
</improved_answer>
{% endif %}
